{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca828b92dabb1442652ef0ca980136c5e030487cfd88d6b9937e39ce4c7d52a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:564b773fd15b2d6865a17b1fdff90046eed96b79ac1950204efea82e83b1c8df",
      "text": "无法服输的对局",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d68f9cebef14fde2f349fd0fd1837ccb833447eeccca7e435e8b67018dd8ba0",
      "text": "某天，直央在练习前前往熟悉的\n将棋俱乐部。随后，\n制作人出现在了那里。\n直央在制作人的注视下，\n下起了一盘将棋……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:564b773fd15b2d6865a17b1fdff90046eed96b79ac1950204efea82e83b1c8df",
      "text": "无法服输的对局",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:743dfa670ce04655b1b69cabe97908900b9f84d022de83b35dea829a382329e4",
      "text": "好……来得挺早。\n这样的话，练习前还能下一盘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f829fe8b5dfad9cbd654b2e4bcd143c33488ea0f2d8d0462717415e705657a4b",
      "text": "（将棋俱乐部里，会有谁在呢……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1019ce4b47eef3a713fadd4214c650d9dabe3282f4934940b66ce01273f4681",
      "text": "（上次还没能对局时间就到了，\n今天要是能下一盘就好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:417f1bc47b0788df89dc2d313591c7fb09c4cf4fbad747af679e7f2332e09737",
      "text": "书上读到的那步棋我也想试试……\n中飞车是基础，真想能熟练掌握啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3628352f36305c453b5e1e53344decc44d14221d9a17a9972f8e88216f467306",
      "text": "将棋俱乐部里也有很擅长进攻的人，\n容易走成筑起防守阵型的局面……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3533a2cb30df0c07c00b7d8938327bf4f5bd65e0869211842d38f08fb7059a0c",
      "text": "……啊，不过也有很擅长穴熊围的人，\n要是和那个人对局的话，说不定能学学进攻的方法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbffd1c007abff49f2a50fc30f2094d1638984442ca88c5046647f5a0d2669ad",
      "text": "将棋俱乐部",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:439e44a82b28f76c2661e4e65537f0f3963df49beaed16276f0938471f86a7d2",
      "text": "你好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b42b66f8324709d6b53df14f175b0bc741b70d409610735246e3ec050e3f0c2f",
      "text": "直央君，欢迎啊。\n今天来得真早。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcb12781e54394a8b7cd10781b1efb6bd625c583c9a740b34c2b4b2082f138f2",
      "text": "是的。请问现在有人能和我下一盘吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5a0b4bbf34a0ea4eed190536813a932334b547b9e176ee90f13551b980d0b27",
      "text": "既然这样，那就老夫来陪你下一盘吧。\n那边的座位空着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43",
      "text": "请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d6d738b6fdffc62c2a50db154a96b478a2ac2847ab77d601546acb502a0891a",
      "text": "那么，用掷驹来决定先手和后手吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14a452f3e0be74a4b126ba6b45f7367df515a83963d0541ebe3a7e30efd7a48e",
      "text": "来来，坐到里面来更方便看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:360b40b95b2044451ffcfa4470ab87d29a8668901b3e77ed7b8353eb85976d28",
      "text": "谢谢您！\n那我就在里面旁观了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c40fe88b8ddb13bbfd1095c2600ed624b8471c7f6ac64f1239991bb71de3832c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，您怎么会在这里……？\n啊……辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e669d27b63bbbe427787ca85ecbfa60bb1817e9a2fb4366feaf364c6e864bf7",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n我刚才看到直央君走进了这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2fce4ea69075dc308b4fd977fd52622090877a1c1a8bc4f9ffd07d1926a75e8",
      "text": "哎呀，是直央君的熟人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26ba6bcc3b7728564dcb0471cee562536510305b94ca3bf897d55fb458405801",
      "text": "是、是的……！是一直关照我的\n制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:873d1a5de7987912e087da415cdf97d384bfd7614e0c1ac9349463dd9f9857ef",
      "text": "这样啊！那可真是幸会。\n如果不介意的话，要不要看看直央君对局啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd66592f4d2f7ef9e5390dfc22869cb7c23ee7b7d5775aea4d448a02d9a375fe",
      "text": "谢谢您。那我就恭敬不如从命了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:424b8b7062d499f3a4c8a5e9307585ff556d07c232afda1dadcde35d2df0a116",
      "text": "（被●●●●プロデューサー看着下棋，\n好紧张啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a1ab5d04679be8b073d0fdbb7b7826eb961e17607ab8733a5759057638f8e6e",
      "text": "那个……那么，我们开始吧。\n……请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ae79d1cd69137180328e0fcbc1686701893bfe049aa0288e9759633f827b906",
      "text": "………………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f84bd67196c16faabebe5b4423ad0a737772f93422c945911352b1604cd3b3f1",
      "text": "（在事务所很少能看到这种表情呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a16281e85754960b8d4275baf69e47e57993ad6d5b0edc041cc2eb2ed2b1e95",
      "text": "（……好强。\n如果继续用现在的防守方式，会被将死的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a550d69da9577127b57e22b0c37e13dcdceb7463675ffbc8363698ed29be0c6c",
      "text": "（但是，有●●●●プロデューサー在看着，\n这场胜负我不想输……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43f542e6c6e7ef42ce971915f9e411c6a9713952a43de14cb01794717a37c028",
      "text": "（……！\n直央君的气场变了……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4c8dfeb4102cc9772298f75f8930a57ca9e0ca51d5b8bddac7454910e5694bf",
      "text": "……好，主动出击吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a305dbe48fdbaa85f61a36d41fa229bd7ea2a16174fdc3a1df1e11fd41ded3c",
      "text": "嗯——这一步棋，\n直央君打算怎么应对呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdcee4d849a7f970b887076984ef9dc05ffcc65cbe83012ee7f58acace92d7d3",
      "text": "（直央君……\n请加油……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284569f8f0135dac344d748832aa542e363ba0ae48eab1d9282c8846782fca2c",
      "text": "……来了！\n这局是我拿下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b9c7bb8421533efe96959d89e48fd536f38f1dd42801c979bc012f6ffebb3af",
      "text": "（刚才那张充满自信的脸庞……\n下将棋的直央君，好帅气啊……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b145732d726b9f5b4792f22a40038b2559ed3e8624629ce0f0d7b542627d2b2a",
      "text": "真是让人捏一把汗的展开呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dd346f15c25b0d9a7d8c4c6eef4b9af1b776494eedc92de0d5ad4c4b406a97e",
      "text": "谁说不是呢。刚才那一步彻底扭转了局势。\n直央君逆转了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59b15029aee926aec8e7d3393a19fe4614b754be3a5fc6b687685b76593759de",
      "text": "认、认输了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e2f6c266805d2aab878de95b680225d0c45f734c11888853b0065e02192dfbb",
      "text": "承蒙指教，非常感谢。\n在千钧一发之际勉强赢下来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1b7d2cc40169250ca8e491f822b515aef2f1916d15073e96def2ab5e1d625b2",
      "text": "哈哈哈，直央君真是温柔啊。\n这局下得很愉快。多谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62d9c3f472fadd0e9cdb4d72b524ab15997eedd851895504aeeceec24c8b60c1",
      "text": "我、我也下得很开心……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b6df578d30de56a4f6197b029aea2f8c1e682c55906fe8100fc3830f63920c9",
      "text": "直央君，恭喜你。\n精彩的逆转！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:484af6658f03517452b0453d71c04b23094e43a11a795c2b1e6586c23fa20a0e",
      "text": "不、哪里……这次只是侥幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:005d3845803718a78b48f75081cd1a7eb275dca9fa9affc0f3339f804e632d5b",
      "text": "差不多到必须出发的时间了。\n制作人，我们走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:046a68862ba1f9d72f447e27b77e0665a82d2f0edcad6210c06e0d000a849a0e",
      "text": "那么各位，我今天就先告辞了。\n下次还会再来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07e2f27e383d295c91b7034050ad22c38c0d41709a6ae16249111e59a91dfde8",
      "text": "好，下次来跟我下一局啊。\n等着直央君再来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21670f77a9ff1b89f71b10cea96d1070ad25ea0df6a227f6620fc885ca7e538e",
      "text": "今天去了将棋俱乐部真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f116710bcf95a21edcaed3841158d64f6798e86221a9ab6e8dd6164b02d0244",
      "text": "下将棋的直央君充满了自信，\n超级帅气哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:405ee3acdab7a8211724fcb3f8ff9c455dfa6a4dd08ca2a74b56c3f2db74f235",
      "text": "谢、谢谢夸奖……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e65addadaad3b4579517fee30985a682a28383a3bb494c278125c2c72c732466",
      "text": "……说起来，●●●●プロデューサー为什么\n会在将棋俱乐部附近呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7bf31e8e630d86edd6525bd659ab2b2cf361250924ddfa78f11d299204bdf8",
      "text": "因为我想着去这附近的一家店，\n给大家买もふもふえん的慰劳品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cae683a79d1e207992163fcdb4bcc52ae9c513e3faf157fef2abd4903387b606",
      "text": "能遇到直央君真是太好了。看了今天的这局棋，\n我想到了一个想让你尝试的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c175c14d17a45b6d1592ba3ef0e562dfa89edb1b0c537e2bc82e57e5f6cb3ee7",
      "text": "诶，工作吗……？\n我能做得到吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c47fabbfdd41eaa45fdb81e9c4a9ef40cd5094f355c63c2e4ba346b6afe8876",
      "text": "是的，当然可以。对局中的直央君，\n非常帅气哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb48f455cdd2c5d4f766c01cf290482fe0bbe555e7d2d427c7928455378f97bf",
      "text": "是、是这样吗……？那个，\n为了回应您的期待，我会努力的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:566dc810823bdfe8a027c9568c2ccebafcb8e83823a2d3fd4d5c7977327094a6",
      "text": "买好慰劳品之后，我们先回趟事务所吧。\n在练习开始前，我想跟你聊聊这份工作的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c14ab1619beb206b6444098878686b38b65aabe05517add58d5b0432a2d4743",
      "text": "好的……！请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
